{"title":"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Square\" title=\"Square\">Square</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Midpoint\" title=\"Midpoint\">midpoint</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbcfabd65745f2b759dea1840f9a0753b2f992e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/8/f381607acc1551ea36ebf2f04eee30607be06b4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle MAN = m\\angle NAP$\" width=\"176\" height=\"13\" />.  Compute the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3bb4eeb347e74e025fd175c22f1f7275af0555e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/8/ae872bd2d686fdfdf276cd736253bbd959031274.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pointpen=black;pathpen=black+linewidth(0.7); pair A=(0,2), D=(0,0), C=(2,0), B=(2,2), M=(C+D)/2, N=(B+C)/2, P=8/3*(N-M)+M; D(MP(&quot;A&quot;,A,(0,1))--MP(&quot;B&quot;,B,(0,1))--MP(&quot;C&quot;,C)--MP(&quot;D&quot;,D)--cycle); D(D(MP(&quot;M&quot;,M))--D(MP(&quot;N&quot;,N,E))--D(MP(&quot;P&quot;,P,E)));  D(M--A--N--A--P); D(anglemark(M,A,P)); MP(&quot;2&quot;,(A+D)/2,W); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"185\" /></center>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/8/20851fc277481d9dd9ee8bb93ea66fa4114674d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MA = NA = \\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/c/6fc64fad5f36300b019edf33db1d2dc8189892f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN = \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/7/1f7f37d5f1783e1eb2f79b1f5feee3d357ce9a7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = \\angle MAN = \\angle NAP$\" width=\"177\" height=\"13\" />. By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Law_of_Cosines\" title=\"Law of Cosines\">Law of Cosines</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5dfe30f7f5e56377ffe96abd13aef18c2fa15f49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle MAN$\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c0993b0d5530c389e3c994f21c553002336cd90f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\sqrt{2}\\right)^2 = \\left(\\sqrt{5}\\right)^2 + \\left(\\sqrt{5}\\right)^2 - 2 \\cdot \\left(\\sqrt{5}\\right) \\cdot \\left(\\sqrt{5}\\right) \\cos \\theta \\Longrightarrow \\cos \\theta = \\frac{4}{5}.\\]\" width=\"475\" height=\"37\" />\nThe Law of Cosines on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/e/69e3ab20b2ec34cdb04d35502752e0b77ae844c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle NAP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> yields\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/f/8bfea20208ef683f90e102b9ac826d0b473ddeb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$NP^2 = AP^2 + \\left(\\sqrt{5}\\right)^2 - 2 \\cdot AP \\cdot \\left(\\sqrt{5}\\right) \\cos \\theta = AP^2 - \\frac{8}{\\sqrt{5}}AP + 5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"515\" height=\"42\" /></center>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle_Bisector_Theorem\" title=\"Angle Bisector Theorem\">Angle Bisector Theorem</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/2/432bb143c723f6a43b0f086fed62b6b0ae0fd444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle MAP$\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" /> yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/f/f0f134c7f46cffaad36e5444cac5dc7ce8adc8ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{AP}{NP} = \\frac{AM}{MN} = \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{2}} \\Longrightarrow NP = \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{5}}AP.\\]\" width=\"307\" height=\"43\" />\nSubstituting, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/8/be80efa3bb16da5f82fdb81b2c1d2933149ac1ae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 0 &amp;= 3AP^2 - 8\\sqrt{5}AP + 25\\\\ AP &amp;= \\frac{8\\sqrt{5} \\pm \\sqrt{20}}{6} = \\boxed{\\frac{5\\sqrt{5}}{3}}, \\sqrt{5}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"253\" height=\"82\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1\">2008 Mock ARML 1</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=206547\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215643\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 181/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 987/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 70/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4981/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.224      1 Template:Mock_ARML_box\n100.00%    7.224      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6944:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017215643 a